<title>UK: BNP unit prices $350 million 10-year Yankee bond.</title>
<headline>BNP unit prices $350 million 10-year Yankee bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond has been priced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS, NEW YORK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS</p>
<p> AMT	  $350 MLN  COUPON     7.20	 MATURITY   15.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.742     PAY DATE   15.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A	REOFFER    99.742     SPREAD	+73 BP</p>
<p> FEES	 0.65	PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
